# Server environment template only. Keep populated values outside the repository and document root.
# Replace 7 (tenant) and 41 (shop) with the actual IDs. Provide separate credentials per environment.
# PHP-FPM must explicitly receive these variables. Never expose them through phpinfo or HTTP logs.
DEWAWI_ALBIS_7_41_TEST_CLIENT_ID=
DEWAWI_ALBIS_7_41_TEST_CLIENT_SECRET=
DEWAWI_ALBIS_7_41_TEST_CACHE_KEY=
DEWAWI_ALBIS_7_41_LIVE_CLIENT_ID=
DEWAWI_ALBIS_7_41_LIVE_CLIENT_SECRET=
DEWAWI_ALBIS_7_41_LIVE_CACHE_KEY=
# CACHE_KEY: base64 of 32 cryptographically random bytes, generated separately per scope.
# Tokens are AES-256-GCM encrypted in Zend_Cache; refresh tokens are discarded.
# Cache TTL: access token <= 600s (30s expiry margin), master data 3600s, quotes 900s,
# unavailable conditions 300s, API/network failures 60s. Credential/key rotation changes cache scope.
# Apply the ALBIS additions in update-1.1.7-1.1.8.sql before enabling.
# If that upgrade has already run, apply only its two new ALBIS ALTER statements after schema inspection.
# Admin > Shop > ALBIS Leasing: default disabled, threshold > EUR 5000 net, group 23, contract 1, payment 2.
# Confirm the actual one-time net processing fee with ALBIS, explicitly entering 0 when agreed.
# Require catalog/inquiry entitlements and explicitly mark each financeable article as eligible.
# Confirm group 23 (commercial kitchen equipment) matches the products and is enabled for the live account.
# Seller-specific master data checks gate calculation. Final live credential/condition acceptance is manual.
# Production suppresses test quotes. Test using APPLICATION_ENV=development with the test environment.
# Public specs (identical on 2026-11-19):
# https://test-api.albis-leasing.de/openapi.json
# https://api.albis-leasing.de/openapi.json
# SHA256 for both: e7ba4aa27a4d9c6f85276c33913fad059e05ab619965d4c71d8282b0bb2e80ea
# Response description uses {raten: [...]}; response example is [...]. Both are accepted.
# No application endpoint, customer data transmission or checkout integration is implemented.
